&lt;p&gt;Building client-side marketing utility calculators in Next.js is a quick way to deliver interactive user experiences without hitting backend APIs. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you want to test a full-featured live tool including industry benchmark breakdowns, check out the live &lt;a href="https://gmcalculator.com/calculators/marketing/cpc-calculator" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;CPC Calculator on GM Calculator&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
